#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
msgid ""
"In addition, the driver recognizes the GoodWe devices GW5K/8K/10K of the ET "
"series (hybrid) and BT series (battery inverter, see below)."
msgstr ""
"Daneben erkennt der Treiber die GoodWe-Geräte GW5K/8K/10K der Serien ET "
"(Hybrid) und BT (Batterie-Wechselrichter, siehe unten)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
msgid ""
"**Control mode:** **SMART** ex works; the system apps do not change it. "
"OpenEMS therefore only intervenes if a function requires it, e.g. price "
"control, emergency reserve or xref:user/storage-control/section-14a-"
"enwg.adoc[§ 14a]."
msgstr ""
"**Steuermodus:** ab Werk **SMART**; die System-Apps ändern ihn nicht. "
"OpenEMS greift damit nur ein, wenn eine Funktion es verlangt, z. B. "
"Preissteuerung, Notstromreserve oder xref:user/storage-control/section-14a-"
"enwg.adoc[§14a]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
msgid ""
"**Other settings on the inverter** (according to the settings of the "
"component): feed-in limit (from the system settings or from the xref:user/"
"storage-control/ripple-control-receiver.adoc[ripple control receiver]), "
"emergency power output, shadow management of the PV inputs and grid "
"connection rules (country code, VDE 4105, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"**Weitere Einstellungen am Wechselrichter** (laut Einstellungen der "
"Komponente): Einspeisegrenze (aus den Systemeinstellungen bzw. vom xref:user/"
"storage-control/ripple-control-receiver.adoc[Rundsteuerempfänger]), Notstrom-"
"Ausgang, Schattenmanagement der PV-Eingänge sowie Netzanschlussregeln "
"(Länderkennung, VDE 4105 u. a.)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
msgid "**Start/stop:** AUTO ex works."
msgstr "**Start/Stopp:** ab Werk AUTO."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "GoodWe BT series"
msgstr "GoodWe-Serie BT"

#. type: #sec-goodwe-bt-series
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
msgid ""
"The GoodWe devices of the BT series are battery inverters **without PV "
"inputs**. They only charge the battery via the alternating current side. The "
"code has **no separate treatment** for them: wherever the driver "
"distinguishes by device type, BT and ET are treated the same. Differences "
"only arise from the fact that no PV inputs are set up on the BT:"
msgstr ""
"Die GoodWe-Geräte der Serie BT sind Batterie-Wechselrichter **ohne PV-"
"Eingänge**. Sie laden die Batterie nur über die Wechselstromseite. Im Code "
"gibt es für sie **keine eigene Behandlung**: Überall, wo der Treiber nach "
"Gerätetyp unterscheidet, werden BT und ET gleich behandelt. Unterschiede "
"ergeben sich nur daraus, dass beim BT keine PV-Eingänge eingerichtet sind:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Point\n"
"| ET (hybrid)\n"
"| BT (without PV inputs)\n"
"\n"
"| PV inputs in the configuration\n"
"| `+GoodWe.Charger…+`\n"
"| none (do not tick “Has DC-PV 1 (MPPT 1)” and “Has DC-PV 2 (MPPT 2)” in the app)\n"
"| Storage power at the grid\n"
"| Battery plus PV power\n"
"| battery power only\n"
"| Maximum charging power from the grid\n"
"| maximum battery charging power minus current PV power\n"
"| full battery charging power (limited by inverter and battery)\n"
"| Charging specification from OpenEMS\n"
"| Charge battery with specification plus PV power\n"
"| Charge battery exactly with the specification\n"
"| Surplus feed-in (PV power that the full battery can no longer absorb)\n"
"| is calculated\n"
"| not applicable\n"
