#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Query only ex works"
msgstr "Ab Werk nur Abfrage"

#. type: #sec-query-only-ex-works
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
msgid ""
"For all PV inverters with a Read-Only setting (SMA, Fronius, Kostal, KACO "
"blueplanet, SolarEdge, Huawei, Sungrow), **Read-Only is switched on ex "
"works**. The apps in the app center (SMA, Fronius, Kostal, KACO, SolarEdge) "
"do not change this setting either. An inverter set up in this way is "
"therefore initially **only queried**. For the limitation to take effect, "
"Read-Only must be switched off in the configuration of the component."
msgstr ""
"Bei allen PV-Wechselrichtern mit Read-Only-Einstellung (SMA, Fronius, "
"Kostal, KACO blueplanet, SolarEdge, Huawei, Sungrow) ist **Read-Only ab Werk "
"eingeschaltet**. Auch die Apps im App Center (SMA, Fronius, Kostal, KACO, "
"SolarEdge) setzen diese Einstellung nicht um. Ein so eingerichteter "
"Wechselrichter wird also zunächst **nur abgefragt**. Damit die Begrenzung "
"wirkt, muss Read-Only in der Konfiguration der Komponente abgeschaltet "
"werden."

#. type: #sec-query-only-ex-works
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
msgid ""
"If a function requests a limitation while Read-Only is active, it is not "
"written. The SunSpec drivers (SMA, Fronius, Kostal, KACO, SolarEdge) report "
"this via the channel `+ReadOnlyModePvLimitFailed+`."
msgstr ""
"Fordert eine Funktion bei aktivem Read-Only eine Begrenzung an, wird sie "
"nicht geschrieben. Die SunSpec-Treiber (SMA, Fronius, Kostal, KACO, "
"SolarEdge) melden das über den Kanal `+ReadOnlyModePvLimitFailed+`."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Query only"
msgstr "Nur Abfrage"

#. type: #sec-query-only
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
msgid ""
"The following components do **not** write any setpoints or limit values to "
"the device, even if some are formally classified as controllable in OpenEMS:"
msgstr ""
"Folgende Komponenten schreiben **keine** Sollwerte oder Grenzwerte an das "
"Gerät, auch wenn manche in OpenEMS formal als steuerbar eingeordnet sind:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Component\n"
"| Device type\n"
"\n"
